  These CMS cross-reference lines appear inline in article text
  after trafilatura extraction. WebExtractor removes any line
  that starts with one of these prefixes (case-sensitive).

  WebPipeline returns [] when extract() returns None — the
  vector store is never called for nav-only pages or login walls.

